      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> DC 19 Fortitude Saving Throw</p>\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> 1d10 Poison Damage damage and Clumsy 1 (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> 2d10 Poison Damage damage and Clumsy 1 (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> 2d10 Poison Damage damage and Clumsy 2 (1 round)</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Knockdown",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p><details><summary>See rules...</summary>\n<p><p><strong>Requirements</strong> The monster's last action was a successful Strike that lists Knockdown in its damage entry</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The monster attempts to Trip the creature. This attempt neither applies nor counts toward the monster's multiple attack penalty.</p></p></details></p>",
